{"n":18,"title":"Free time, honestly","blurb":"Рассказывать о своих увлечениях","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"Free time, honestly","sub":"","html":"<p>Что ты говоришь, что делаешь в выходные — и что делаешь на самом деле.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Говорить, что вам нравится делать</li><li>Говорить, что вам не нравится делать</li><li>Спрашивать о свободном времени</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Что вы делаете в свободное время?","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"read"},{"label":"watch TV"},{"label":"cook"},{"label":"play sport"},{"label":"listen to music"},{"label":"take photos"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"read","pos":"","ru":"читать","kk":"оқу","def":"I like reading at home.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/f22675ef2ad4.mp3"},{"en":"listen to music","pos":"","ru":"слушать музыку","kk":"музыка тыңдау","def":"I love listening to music.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/38aa8d13d325.mp3"},{"en":"cook","pos":"","ru":"готовить","kk":"тамақ пісіру","def":"She likes cooking.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/d75c236943df.mp3"},{"en":"go out with friends","pos":"","ru":"гулять с друзьями","kk":"достармен серуендеу","def":"I like going out with friends.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/081877cc9446.mp3"},{"en":"play sport","pos":"","ru":"заниматься спортом","kk":"спортпен айналысу","def":"I like playing sport.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/72629edb76a2.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите занятие.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/f22675ef2ad4.mp3","prompt":"","options":["cook","read","travel"],"answer":"read","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите занятие.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/081877cc9446.mp3","prompt":"","options":["go out with friends","play sport","watch TV"],"answer":"go out with friends","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"hobby","pos":"","ru":"хобби","kk":"хобби","def":"Do you have any hobbies?","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"free time","pos":"","ru":"свободное время","kk":"бос уақыт","def":"What do you do in your free time?","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"take photos","pos":"","ru":"фотографировать","kk":"сурет түсіру","def":"I like taking photos.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/f3871c3aa54f.mp3"},{"en":"play video games","pos":"","ru":"играть в видеоигры","kk":"видеоойын ойнау","def":"He loves playing video games.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/d3c0d8ab86b6.mp3"},{"en":"go to the cinema","pos":"","ru":"ходить в кино","kk":"киноға бару","def":"We like going to the cinema.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/7832d2e9a563.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините слово и перевод.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"read","right":"читать"},{"left":"take photos","right":"фотографировать"},{"left":"cook","right":"готовить"},{"left":"listen to music","right":"слушать музыку"},{"left":"go to the cinema","right":"ходить в кино"},{"left":"play sport","right":"заниматься спортом"}],"options":["слушать музыку","читать","фотографировать","готовить","ходить в кино","заниматься спортом"]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Слушайте окончание второго слова.","items":[{"text":"I like reading.","src":null},{"text":"I love listening to music.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"like / love / hate + -ing","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Чувство</th><th>Предложение</th><th>Значение</th></tr><tr><td>love</td><td>I love dancing.</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>like</td><td>I like reading.</td><td>good</td></tr><tr><td>don't like</td><td>I don't like going out.</td><td>not good</td></tr><tr><td>hate</td><td>I hate watching football.</td><td>0%</td></tr></table><p>После like, love, hate глагол получает <b>-ing</b>: I like read<b>ing</b>.</p><p>В уроке 1 было <b>like</b> + предмет: I like coffee. Оба варианта верны.</p><p>Нельзя «I like to reading» или «I like read».</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как пишется -ing","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Глагол</th><th>-ing</th><th>Правило</th></tr><tr><td>read</td><td>reading</td><td>just add -ing</td></tr><tr><td>dance</td><td>dancing</td><td>-e goes away</td></tr><tr><td>swim</td><td>swimming</td><td>double the last letter</td></tr></table><p>Большинство глаголов просто получают <b>-ing</b>: watch → watching.</p><p>Конечная <b>-e</b> исчезает: dance → dancing.</p><p>Короткие глаголы удваивают последнюю букву: swim → swimming.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">На Do you like…? отвечают Yes, I do. / No, I don't.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["I like swimming and taking photos.","I don't like going out.","I love listening to music.","I hate watching football on TV.","Do you like dancing?","Yes, I do, but I can't dance very well."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I like ___ in the evening.","options":["read","to reading","reading"],"keep":false,"answer":"reading","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She loves ___ to music.","options":["listening","listen","listens"],"keep":false,"answer":"listening","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"He likes ___ in the sea.","options":["swiming","swimming","swim"],"keep":false,"answer":"swimming","why":"Короткие глаголы удваивают букву: swim → swimming.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"Нравится или нет?","sub":"","columns":["Нравится","Не нравится"],"items":[{"text":"I love dancing.","col":0},{"text":"It's really boring.","col":1},{"text":"I don't like going out.","col":1},{"text":"My hobby is football.","col":0},{"text":"I like reading.","col":0},{"text":"I hate cooking.","col":1}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She likes","after":"dinner for friends.","answers":["cooking"],"bank":["to cooking","cooking","cook"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I love","after":"out at the weekend.","answers":["going"],"bank":["goes","going","go"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"We hate","after":"home on Saturday.","answers":["staying"],"bank":["staying","stayed","stay"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Do you like dancing?","options":["Yes, I like.","Yes, I do.","Yes, I am."],"keep":false,"answer":"Yes, I do.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Do you like watching football?","options":["No, I don't.","No, I doesn't.","No, I not."],"keep":false,"answer":"No, I don't.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["I","like","taking","photos."],"answer":"I like taking photos.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["She","music.","loves","to","listening"],"answer":"She loves listening to music.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["you","going","the","cinema?","like","to","Do"],"answer":"Do you like going to the cinema?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","like","to","reading."],"bad":2,"answer":"I like reading.","why":"Перед формой на -ing нет to."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","love","cooking."],"bad":1,"answer":"She loves cooking.","why":"С she глагол получает -s."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","like","danceing."],"bad":2,"answer":"I like dancing.","why":"Конечная -e исчезает: dance → dancing."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/ab8ac98cbf03.mp3","prompt":"Что нравится делать Ане?","options":["cooking and reading","swimming and taking photos","dancing and singing"],"answer":"swimming and taking photos","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/4540c281aadf.mp3","prompt":"Мужчина любит выходить куда-то?","options":["Yes, very much.","No, he doesn't.","Only at weekends."],"answer":"No, he doesn't.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/4540c281aadf.mp3","before":"I like","after":"and listening to music at home.","answers":["reading"],"bank":["reading","cooking","dancing"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/08a84be563dc.mp3","prompt":"Что нравится её мужу?","options":["going out","being at home","seeing friends"],"answer":"being at home","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/0d8ccf43df34.mp3","prompt":"Что она любит делать по выходным?","options":["getting up late and going shopping","working","staying at home"],"answer":"getting up late and going shopping","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/6086570c697e.mp3","prompt":"Марк любит танцевать?","options":["Yes, but he can't dance well.","No, he hates it.","He loves it."],"answer":"Yes, but he can't dance well.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/8090c79498c3.mp3","before":"I like","after":"sport and I like swimming.","answers":["playing"],"bank":["playing","play","played"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Руслана.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ruslan</p><p>Hi! I'm Ruslan. I love playing football.</p><p>I play twice a week with my friends.</p><p>I don't like watching TV. It's boring.</p><p>My wife loves reading. She hates football!</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Ruslan loves playing football.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ruslan</p><p>Hi! I'm Ruslan. I love playing football.</p><p>I play twice a week with my friends.</p><p>I don't like watching TV. It's boring.</p><p>My wife loves reading. She hates football!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"His wife likes football.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ruslan</p><p>Hi! I'm Ruslan. I love playing football.</p><p>I play twice a week with my friends.</p><p>I don't like watching TV. It's boring.</p><p>My wife loves reading. She hates football!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"He doesn't like","after":"TV.","answers":["watching"],"bank":["watches","watching","watch"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ruslan</p><p>Hi! I'm Ruslan. I love playing football.</p><p>I play twice a week with my friends.</p><p>I don't like watching TV. It's boring.</p><p>My wife loves reading. She hates football!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своём свободном времени.","sub":"Что вы любите и что вам не нравится.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I love ___ .</li><li>I don't like ___ .</li><li>My ___ likes ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I love</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I like</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I don't like</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I hate</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">reading</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">cooking</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">swimming</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">going out</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">watching TV</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">playing football</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Каждый глагол после like/love/hate — с <b>-ing</b>.</li><li>Перед формой на -ing нет <b>to</b>.</li><li>Про другого человека — <b>-s</b>: she like<b>s</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Окончание -ing звучит одним мягким звуком.","items":["I like reading.","I love listening to music.","I don't like going out.","Do you like dancing?"]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 18 пройден","sub":"Урок 18 из 24 · Юнит 5","items":["Я могу сказать, что люблю делать.","Я могу сказать, что мне не нравится делать.","Я могу спросить Do you like…?"]}]}
